#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1283
msgid ""
"With this option, you can customize the easing of the Smart Background "
"animation for supported transition types, such as Loop and Parallax. By "
"adjusting the easing, you can control how smoothly or dynamically the "
"background content moves in relation to the layer. This gives you even more "
"flexibility to fine-tune the visual flow of your animations."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1285
msgid ""
"An easing is the timing function of the animation. With it, you can "
"manipulate the movement of the animated object. Please click on the link to "
"open <a href=\"https://easings.net/\" target=\"_blank\">easings.net</a> for "
"more information and more detailed examples."
